                                             "Robots all over Rubi-Ka carry strange parts. I need eight of them, one of each:",
                                             "{delay 1}Suspicious Looking Parts of Biotechnology, Liquid Based Conductors, Scrap of Notum, Large and partly fused lump of strange tetrahedral CPU bundles, Microscopic Pulsating Nano Crystals, Ancient Looking Lamp Relay, Bundle of Nano-Tubes, Highly plastic mother-circuit array.",
                                             "{delay 1}Machines drop them, even the junk robots and dockers around the newcomer areas. They are unique, so you can only hold one of each."
                                         ],
